---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Utilidades
description: Ferramentas e utilidades para QA
ogType: website
---

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-12">
      <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">
        <i class="bi bi-tools me-2"></i>Utilidades
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted lead">Ferramentas e recursos criados para facilitar o dia a dia de QA.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4">
    {% for ferramenta in ferramentas %}
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 hover-shadow transition-all position-relative">
        <div class="card-body p-4 text-center d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
          <div class="mb-3">
            <i class="bi {{ ferramenta.icone }} fs-1 text-{{ ferramenta.cor }}"></i>
          </div>
          <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2">{{ ferramenta.nome }}</h5>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-3">{{ ferramenta.descricao }}</p>
          <a href="{{ ferramenta.url }}" class="btn btn-{{ ferramenta.cor }} stretched-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-1"></i>Acessar
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
